        "text": "The target is California's state row, without seasonal adjustment, in CMS dataset 5abea2e0-3f8e-4b49-a50d-d63d5fd9103c. CMS's Coverage Retention and Disenrollment Rates by State table expresses ex parte renewals as a percentage of beneficiaries due for renewal. I therefore interpret the ledger's unnamed denominator as Metric 5 and the numerator as Metric 5a1. All historical anchors use original monthly outcomes, excluding the separate updated-outcome tables."
